{"seq":6,"slug":"nursing","title":"高等职业教育护理学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":11,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing","introMarkdown":"# 高等职业教育护理学\n\n我决定认真把护理这门学问从头啃一遍，是因为有一次陪家人住院，看着护士在病床边有条不紊地测体温、换药、记录出入量、安抚情绪，我才意识到：护理远不是\"打针发药\"那么简单，它是一门把医学知识、沟通技巧和动手能力揉在一起的实践科学。\n\n高职护理和中职护理最大的区别，在于\"系统\"和\"深入\"两个词。中职阶段更偏向把单项操作练熟，而高职阶段要求你理解操作背后的原理——为什么这个病人要半卧位，为什么术后要早期下床，为什么补钾不能直接静推。换句话说，高职护理培养的是能独立判断、能参与临床决策的护士，而不只是执行指令的人。\n\n这个学习手册按照临床护理的真实知识脉络分成四章。第一章是地基：护理程序、健康评估和基础护理技能，这些贯穿你今后所有专科工作。第二章进入内科和外科护理，这是医院里病人最多、护士最需要硬功夫的两大战场，也是各类护士执业考试的重头戏。第三章聚焦专科护理，把妇产、儿科和急危重症这三个\"特殊人群、特殊场景\"单独拎出来讲，因为它们的护理逻辑和成人内外科很不一样。第四章谈护理管理与循证护理，这是从\"做护士\"走向\"做好护士、带团队\"的关键一跃。\n\n我在写每一节时，都尽量站在一个自学者的角度：先讲清楚\"这是什么、为什么重要\"，再用临床场景和类比把抽象概念落地，最后留几道能自测的思考题。涉及计算的地方（比如输液速度、给药剂量、休克指数）我都会把公式写清楚并带例子，因为这些是考试和临床都绕不开的硬指标。\n\n需要提醒的是，护理知识更新很快。2026年国家卫健委把老年、儿科、重症监护、急诊急救、康复列为护士培训的补短板重点方向，循证护理也从\"前沿概念\"变成了日常工作要求。所以这份手册给你的是框架和思路，真正的权威依据始终是最新的临床指南、专家共识和你所在医院的操作规范。\n\n学完这四章，你应该能看懂一份住院病历的护理记录，能说清常见病的护理要点，能在急救场景里知道先做什么后做什么，也能用循证的眼光去质疑\"一直都这么做\"的旧习惯。这就是高职护理想带你到达的地方。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nursing-fundamentals","title":"护理学基础与健康评估","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/nursing-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nursing-process-and-care-models","title":"护理程序与护理理论模型","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/nursing-fundamentals/nursing-process-and-care-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vital-signs-and-health-assessment","title":"生命体征与健康评估","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/nursing-fundamentals/vital-signs-and-health-assessment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"basic-nursing-skills-and-safety","title":"基础护理操作与病人安全","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/nursing-fundamentals/basic-nursing-skills-and-safety"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"medical-surgical-nursing","title":"内外科护理","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/medical-surgical-nursing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"medical-nursing-common-diseases","title":"内科常见病护理","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/medical-surgical-nursing/medical-nursing-common-diseases"},{"seq":2,"slug":"surgical-nursing-and-perioperative-care","title":"外科护理与围手术期管理","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/medical-surgical-nursing/surgical-nursing-and-perioperative-care"},{"seq":3,"slug":"critical-care-monitoring-basics","title":"重症监护基础","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/medical-surgical-nursing/critical-care-monitoring-basics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"specialty-nursing","title":"专科护理(妇儿急危重)","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/specialty-nursing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"maternal-and-child-nursing","title":"母婴护理","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/specialty-nursing/maternal-and-child-nursing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pediatric-nursing-essentials","title":"儿科护理要点","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/specialty-nursing/pediatric-nursing-essentials"},{"seq":3,"slug":"emergency-and-critical-care-nursing","title":"急危重症护理","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/specialty-nursing/emergency-and-critical-care-nursing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"nursing-management-evidence","title":"护理管理与循证护理","docCount":2,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/nursing-management-evidence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nursing-management-and-quality","title":"护理管理与质量","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/nursing-management-evidence/nursing-management-and-quality"},{"seq":2,"slug":"evidence-based-nursing-practice","title":"循证护理实践","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/nursing-management-evidence/evidence-based-nursing-practice"}]}]}